                "text": "It\u2019s hard to believe, but gaps in federal law can allow health care providers to deny life-saving care to babies born alive after an attempted abortion. H.R. 21 fixes this. It requires the same life-saving care to be given to a baby born after a failed abortion as would be given to any other prematurely born baby. As millions of people march for life today, I am proud to have cosponsored and supported H.R. 21.\n\nhttps://t.co/GnAlFSNQpX",
